nlink-parser-ros2 (2.1.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Package the RoboParty fork of nlink_parser_ros2 for ROS 2 Jazzy.
  * Depend on the standalone ros-jazzy-serial package instead of vendoring serial.
  * Build for C++17, required by the Jazzy rclcpp headers.
  * Install under the configured install prefix (default /opt/roboparty) for the RoboParty UWB integration.

